# Both container images are built with the repository root as their context,
# because each needs a workspace module alongside its own app directory:
# `apps/computer-host` needs `computer/host-{protocol,runtime}`, and
# `apps/applet-build` needs `applets/sdk` and the build contract. Everything
# else stays out of the context.
*
!apps/computer-host
!apps/applet-build
!computer/package.json
!computer/host-protocol
!computer/host-runtime
!applets/package.json
!applets/build-contract.ts
!applets/sdk
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/out
**/.wrangler
**/.dev.vars
